		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A dismal blend of a boar's head, bear's body, and elk's hooves and horns. Stinks like carrion, lairs in muck and filth.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 43, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +8 (3d6) and 1 gore +8 (2d8) or 1 toxic breath, <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Charge</strong>. In place of attacks, move up to double near in a straight line and make 1 gore attack. If hit, x3 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Toxic Breath</strong>. Fills a near- sized cube extending from catoblepas. CON 15+ or 3d6 CON damage, dies at 0 CON.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
